fossunited\docs\docs\changelog.md:
  267  - [#1379](https://github.com/fossunited/fossunited/pull/1379) **Event Grant Doctype Updates**
  268:   Added new fields (`event_description`, status options like "Ongoing" and "Disbursed") to Event Grant doctype for better tracking via web forms.
  269  

  318  - [#1342](https://github.com/fossunited/fossunited/pull/1342) **Edit Event Button for Concluded Events**
  319:   Added "Edit Event" button visible to organisers even for concluded events. Uses proper permission checks via `check_if_chapter_or_event_core_member`.
  320    Credits: [@Pranav1921](https://github.com/Pranav1921)

  782    Related issue [#1144](https://github.com/fossunited/fossunited/issues/1144) and PR [#1145](https://github.com/fossunited/fossunited/pull/1145)
  783: - [#1128](https://github.com/fossunited/fossunited/pull/1128) Small Doc on purpose of `event_permalink`
  784    Some users might confuse with the term permalink, so added some doc to give info that it means page 'route' (alias)

